{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1bd5a8bcd366219f0dc555becd116776ec168648e1bf743da00f9fb3a3e60f77", "ja": "今日の撮影、企業に就職したみたいっていうか……\nお仕事体験してるみたいで、とっても楽しいんです♪", "zh": "今天的拍摄，就像是入职了一家公司一样……不，应该说像是在体验工作，特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "97d0cbe9da906e3d89dc682dbd5649b6e3ceee41cd666fbb99d4b452c5d527e6", "ja": "あっ、でもお仕事ですから、真面目にやりますよ！\n私ばっかり楽しんでちゃダメですし。", "zh": "啊，不过毕竟是工作，我会认真对待的！\n不能只顾着自己开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1118fa41bf96b55ccf8cee5eee13cc98dceb93e4d3ec5bef86446fd5971e9f08", "ja": "はは、そうか。でも撮影なんだし、\n楽しむくらいでちょうどいいと思うけどな。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。不过毕竟是在拍摄，我觉得开心一点才正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "32f3aadecd5738f9505c6473bd09d59a11e26ff0c90cc084126f10f10bf6af13", "ja": "{$P$}さんったら……ふふっ。\nじゃあお言葉に甘えて、楽しんじゃおうかな？", "zh": "{$P$}先生真是的……呵呵。\n那我就恭敬不如从命，好好乐在其中吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dbc5e96ae95f7eac310b19d61d03d5fef73f01f37dc612106ec019a1958b2ae3", "ja": "私、アイドルになる前は看護師だったから、\nこんな風にオフィスで働いたことってないんです。", "zh": "我在成为偶像之前是护士，\n所以从来没有在办公室里工作过呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b180bd7dc2d8090b95d6b971761c2577ac44d47e10d610c52de728b57ab1a51b", "ja": "制服でオフィスワーク、どんなお仕事でしょうね？\n窓口業務とか、受付とか……。", "zh": "穿着制服坐在办公室里工作，会是什么样的工作呢？\n比如窗口工作、接待之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7be664cf3fd053e5a503cd08c6bb5daa49f56af711710f7625e152c01568a314", "ja": "そうだな……\n風花なら、秘書なんかも似合いそうだけど。", "zh": "是啊……\n如果是风花，当秘书似乎也很合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a8c2bcd885c1cb9c27014362a0d25da0a05d2d1c8c0048d11c38ed98cf12aa69", "ja": "わぁ、秘書ですか？\n難しそうですけど……ん、ん。", "zh": "哇，秘书吗？\n虽然感觉挺难的……嗯、咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d15def083f83781e9e3f09081301c4fbd5e998d807b811fa373227c89ca2aa76", "ja": "「お疲れさまです、社長。\nスケジュールの確認、お願いしますね」", "zh": "“辛苦了，社长。\n请确认一下日程安排哦。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e3d10cb73d10f029c44ac7968b795acb7ca4c2786ec7cd96434482edc15454f2", "ja": "……なんちゃって。\nあの、どうでした？　それっぽく見えましたか？", "zh": "……开玩笑的啦。\n那个，感觉怎么样？看起来有模有样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d67311f7deeb7523ac3fe0ff057515dcc9d5af5fa8603ea479ed162413e637b5", "ja": "おお……いいんじゃないか？　制服も似合ってるし、\n風花ならオフィスワークでも活躍しそうだけど……。", "zh": "哦……挺不错的嘛？制服也很适合你，\n要是风花的话，就算做办公室工作应该也能大显身手，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a233c506c2c8831f8c021a3a084b94db60b19fdccbd0e2116bf5117a6817a7ef", "ja": "けど？", "zh": "不过？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9f3155f898579fbd5a82bb055a53d8df602091622ad92873c98e3000b0cf1e00", "ja": "けどやっぱり、風花にはアイドルでいてほしいかな！", "zh": "不过果然，我还是希望风花能继续当偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d8925f8ca5672b97627ecd97d53dd4742ef577e740ce1fbc3d1a20bd4df168b9", "ja": "{$P$}さんったら……もう。\nそんなこと言われたら、うれしくなっちゃいますよ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生真是的……\n被您这么一说，我都忍不住开心起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0153_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d82f0d3532c5ccea94a845f9abead36b52aeef739072d19f6cae769d976a919d", "ja": "それじゃ、今日はアイドルとして……\n制服グラビアのお仕事、がんばってきますね♪", "zh": "那么，今天就以偶像的身份……努力完成制服写真的工作吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
